{"id":"msg_m_ex_ether_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_ether","label":"Ether · Nikke"},"label":"2. No. 7, what are you doing?","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_ether_01","next":"msg_m_ex_ether_03","speakers":{"ether":"Ether"},"icons":{"ether":"si_c291_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_1","text":"No. 7, what are you doing?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_2","text":"Are you busy?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_3","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_3","text":"What's up?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_4","text":"Nothing much, really.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_5","text":"I'm bored is all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_6","text":"Something's not right...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_7","text":"Hey, c'mon!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_8","text":"I reach out to you because I'm bored","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_9","text":"and you start attacking me right off the bat!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_10","text":"I'm hurt!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_11","text":"Does M.M.R. even have the time to be bored?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_12","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_13","text":"My oh my!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_14","text":"You're really on your game today!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_15","text":"You haven't been taking brain boosters on the sly, have you?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_16","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_16","text":"It doesn't take a genius to figure this one out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_17","text":"All right, fair enough.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_18","text":"I didn't realize you were so perceptive.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_19","text":"My apologies.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_20","text":"Since you're so smart already,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_21","text":"my medicine will make you even smarter.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_22","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_22","text":"Medicine?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_23","text":"It actually isn't medicine per se,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_24","text":"but it's more like supplements.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_25","text":"Does that sound any better?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_26","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_26","text":"I won't take it even if it's a supplement.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_27","text":"Why not? Just try one?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_28","text":"It'll help improve your memory.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_29","text":"I ran a bunch of tests.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_30","text":"Out of everyone I could choose,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_31","text":"you're the lucky recipient for this wonder drug... um... supplement!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_32","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_32","text":"Are there any side effects?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_33","text":"Side effects?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_34","text":"Of course...","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_35","text":"there are :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_36","text":"I won't take it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_37","text":"All you'll get is a little nosebleed","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_38","text":"and feel a bit light-headed twice a day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_39","text":"In exchange, it'll allow you to stay awake for longer periods.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_40","text":"Not a bad trade-off, wouldn't you say?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_41","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_41","text":"That's not becoming smarter.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_42","text":"If you can stay awake longer,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_43","text":"you can invest that time into acquiring more knowledge.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_44","text":"Ergo, you'll become smarter!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_45","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_45","text":"I still won't take it","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_46","text":"Sigh... too bad.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_47","text":"I thought someone like you with long-term goals","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_48","text":"would find the notion","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_49","text":"of staying up longer enticing.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_50","text":"I figured the whole 'making you smarter' thing wasn't so important.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_51","text":"I must admit, I didn't see this coming.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_52","text":"If you ended up getting a nosebleed,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_53","text":"I was going to take you into my cozy little lab","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_54","text":"under the pretext of you contracting a strange disease up on the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_55","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_55","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_56","text":"Much to my dismay, you're a crafty little one today! :)","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_57","text":"Oh well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_58","text":"I'll just have to try again next time :3","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_59","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_59","text":"Please don't.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_ether_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"ether","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_ether_02_60","text":"We'll see :)","jump":null}],"chat":true}